{
  "title": "首次 MISS，第二次 HIT（nginx/1.31.5 实测）",
  "lines": [
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si http://localhost/ | grep -E '^HTTP|X-Proxy-Cache'"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "X-Proxy-Cache: MISS"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "缓存没有这个键：回源，并把响应写入磁盘"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si http://localhost/ | grep X-Proxy-Cache"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "X-Proxy-Cache: HIT"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "同一请求第二次：不再碰后端，直接吃本地缓存"}
  ]
}
